# Space NASA Challenge 2026

This repository is initialized as the base for a browser-based health assessment tool for astronauts.

## Local setup

Open the project in a browser directly or serve it locally with a simple static http server.

```bash
python -m http.server 8000
```

Then open:

http://localhost:8000

## Project structure

```text
space-nasa-challenge-2026/
├── README.md
├── .gitignore
├── index.html
├── src/
│   ├── main.js
│   ├── styles.css
│   ├── components/
│   │   └── HealthPanel.js
│   ├── data/
│   │   └── health-metrics.js
│   ├── services/
│   │   └── assessment.js
│   └── utils/
│       └── formatters.js
├── tests/
│   └── assessment.test.js
├── docs/
│   └── roadmap.md
└── assets/
    └── README.md
```
